{"id": "p000-003", "text": "georgia's gone veggie and her husband bruno is full vegan. she's into wild swimming, he's been doing pottery classes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "veggie", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "bruno", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "wild swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "p000-008", "text": "dinner w/ akira and aiko suzuki last night. aiko just got promoted to head of dept!! her eldest phoebe is off to edinburgh uni end of sept and aiko's not coping lol. akira's got a dodgy knee, he's seeing a specialist the week after next", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "aiko suzuki", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "aiko", "pronoun": "she", "occ": 2}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to head of dept", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "phoebe", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to edinburgh uni", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of sept", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dodgy knee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seeing a specialist", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after next", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "p000-009", "text": "spoke to kemal, his mum has a scan tues morning and he's worried sick. must ring him that evening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tues morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried sick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "p000-012", "text": "hadiza rang from the hosptial, her husband farid had gallbladder surgery this morning. went ok and he gets discharged friday, remind me to check in w/ him the next day. she's exhuasted and her sister's got the kids. I should pop round tmrw w/ some food", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "hadiza", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "farid", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "discharged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w/ him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhuasted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw", "anchor": "a2"}]}
