{"id": "p000-039", "text": "sinead walsh from work told me her dad's been diagnosed w/ parkinsons. she's going part time from next month to help her mum look after him, and her mum isn't coping great either apparently. hasn't told anyone else so keep it quiet. I should ask her how he's doing every few wks. she loves the salted caramel brownies from the market, need to get her some friday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "sinead walsh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "parkinsons", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't coping great", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how he's doing", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every few wks", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "salted caramel brownies", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her some", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
